[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0010","text":"诶……\n好厉害～～～！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0020","text":"快看快看摩美美、雾子——！\n超漂亮的～！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0030","text":"哇……\n呵呵……好美呢……花朵也是……香气也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0040","text":"恋钟酱……\n谢谢你帮我找到……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0050","text":"拍张照～！\n……不行，手上沾了水……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0060","text":"诶诶……\n拍不好～～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0070","text":"恋钟——，我先去参拜了——\n“希望演唱会顺利结束”——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0080","text":"诶！？　原来是为了这个才来的……！\n但是……等、等一下～！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0090","text":"……呵呵——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0100","text":"好了，拍到了\n花手水和雾子——还有手忙脚乱的恋钟"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400500_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
